# inc-yam9: session for INCURSION_TRUE_ILLUSION_PROBE (src/TrueIllusionProbe.cpp).
# The probe runs once at the start of Game::Play, after the fixture loads, so
# this script only needs a clean exit. Read by tools/check_true_illusions.sh.
# SPACE, never ESC, clears a "-- more --"; the single ESC opens the System Menu
# for the quit.
SPACE*5
@quit
